# Package.resolved is NOT committed: the root file is shared between the
# standalone KoeKit SwiftPM package (`swift test` → GRDB only) and the Koe.app
# Xcode target (`xcodebuild` → GRDB + KeyboardShortcuts), which rewrite it to
# different contents on every build, so no committed version stays clean.
# Reproducibility is pinned in the manifests instead: GRDB in Package.swift,
# KeyboardShortcuts exactVersion in project.yml. (docs/decisions.md, session 7)
Package.resolved
# Generated by XcodeGen from project.yml (source of truth)
Koe.xcodeproj/

